OL,3,ABarclays cutting 5,000 jobs as it
OL,4,Aincreases reliance on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays is cutting around 5,000 staff
OL,7,Fthis year as it introduces more
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence (AI) into its
OL,9,Fprocesses.
OL,11,FThe banking group said 1,000 posts had
OL,12,Falready been closed and it expects a
OL,13,Ffurther reduction of 4,000 to be
OL,14,Fcomplete by the end of 2026.
OL,16,FThe cuts amount to 5% of its global
OL,17,Fworkforce with most of them among
OL,18,Foperational and functional roles.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
