OL,3,ABarclays cutting 5,000 jobs as it
OL,4,Aincreases reliance on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays said the cuts were the result
OL,7,Fof investments in technology, with AI
OL,8,Fmaking some work processes more
OL,9,Fefficient.
